---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Nashville Home & Auto Insurance | Independent Advisor"
  description="Independent home and auto insurance review for Nashville residents. We analyze your coverage, find the gaps, and explain what your policy actually covers — not just your premium."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-navy-300 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-green-400">Home & Auto</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Home &amp; Auto Insurance</h1>
      <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Most Nashville homeowners have gaps in their coverage they don't know about. We find them before a claim does.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">

        <!-- Primary Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">
            What We Review in Your Home &amp; Auto Coverage
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Your homeowners policy has exclusions buried in it — water damage, jewelry, home offices, trampolines, pools, short-term rentals, business equipment. Most people find out what's not covered when they file a claim and get denied. We read your actual policy, explain what it covers and what it doesn't, and show you where the gaps are before something goes wrong.</p>
            <p>Auto coverage is more complicated than most people realize. Liability limits, uninsured motorist coverage, gap insurance if you're financing, rental reimbursement, roadside — and if you have teenage drivers or let friends borrow your vehicles, your exposure changes significantly. We review your full auto picture the same way we review everything else: together, clearly, no jargon.</p>
            <p>Umbrella coverage is the one most people skip and the one that matters most when something serious happens. If you have a pool, a trampoline, a dog, teenage drivers, or rental property — you need to understand what your liability exposure actually looks like. We'll tell you honestly whether umbrella makes sense for your situation and what it would cost.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Coverage Areas -->
          <div class="mt-12">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Coverage Areas We Review</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              {[
                'Homeowners / Dwelling',
                'Auto (Personal)',
                'Personal Umbrella',
                'Renters Insurance',
                'Scheduled Personal Property',
                'Flood & Earthquake',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-navy-900">{item}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>


          <!-- Contextual links into the supporting blog cluster (site audit, Priority 3). -->
          <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">Keep Reading on Home &amp; Auto</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-base leading-relaxed">
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/how-much-home-insurance-do-you-need-nashville" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">How much home insurance you actually need in Nashville</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — the sizing question, worked through with real numbers.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/replacement-cost-vs-actual-cash-value-nashville" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Replacement cost vs. actual cash value</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — the single most misunderstood line on a homeowners policy.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/what-rising-home-values-mean-for-your-insurance-coverage-in-nashville" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">What rising home values mean for your coverage</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — why a policy written five years ago is probably short today.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/need-home-insurance-fast-nashville-closing" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Need coverage in two weeks?</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — how a closing-deadline bind actually works.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/does-my-homeowners-policy-cover-my-airbnb-nashville" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Does your homeowners policy cover your Airbnb?</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — short-term rental exposure most Nashville hosts miss.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/blog/do-i-need-umbrella-insurance-nashville" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Do you need umbrella insurance in Nashville?</a>
                <span class="text-gray-600"> — when the liability limits underneath stop being enough.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              We review home and auto coverage across the Nashville metro, with dedicated pages for
              <a href="/neighborhoods/brentwood" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Brentwood</a> and
              <a href="/neighborhoods/franklin" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">Franklin</a>.
              See the <a href="/neighborhoods/" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-800">full list of areas we serve</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-900 text-white">
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Schedule a Review</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-200 text-sm mb-5">
                We'll review your current home and auto policies, identify gaps, and explain your options clearly.
              </p>
              <a
                href="/contact"
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 bg-green-50 hover:bg-white text-navy-900 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Book a Coverage Check
              </a>
              <a
                href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 mt-3 border border-navy-600 hover:border-navy-400 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Call {BRAND.phone}
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
              <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Related Services</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li><a href="/services/small-business" class="text-sm text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors">Small Business Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/life-insurance" class="text-sm text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors">Life Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/retirement-income" class="text-sm text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors">Retirement Income Planning →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/long-term-care" class="text-sm text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 transition-colors">Long-Term Care →</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
